./cmd/sha1sum/... -count=1 passes all tests including new R2 and R3.1 differential tests\n      - id: AC3\n        text: All srd031 R2.1, R2.2, R2.3, and R3.1 requirements are implemented as specified in the SRD\n\n- index: 3\n  title: \"[stitch] cmd/sha1sum -- srd031 R3.2, R4.1-R4.3\"\n  dependency: 2\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd031-sha1sum.yaml (SRD for sha1sum -- focus on R3.2 and R4.1-R4.3)\n      - cmd/sha1sum/main.go (existing implementation from previous tasks with R1-R2 and R3.1)\n      - cmd/sha1sum/sha1sum_test.go (existing differential tests)\n      - pkg/hashutil/ (shared hash utility library -- provides VerifyChecksums, CheckOptions)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/sha1sum/main.go\n        action: modify\n        note: Complete R3.2 check mode and add R4.1-R4.3 functionality\n      - path: cmd/sha1sum/sha1sum_test.go\n        action: modify\n        note: Add differential tests covering R3.2 and R4.1-R4.3\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: Implement srd031 R3.2 per the SRD specification\n      - id: R2\n        text: Implement srd031 R4.1 per the SRD specification\n      - id: R3\n        text: Implement srd031 R4.2 per the SRD specification\n      - id: R4\n        text: Implement srd031 R4.3 per the SRD specification\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: Use pkg/hashutil.VerifyChecksums and pkg/hashutil.CheckOptions for check mode verification\n      - id: D2\n        text: Follow the same flag names and behaviors as the GNU gsha1sum reference binary\n      - id: D3\n        text: Reference binary for differential testing is gsha1sum from Homebrew coreutils\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: go build ./cmd/sha1sum/ compiles without errors\n      - id: AC2\n        text: go test ./cmd/sha1sum/... -count=1 passes all tests including new R3.2 and R4 differential tests\n      - id: AC3\n        text: All srd0